SUMMARY:Therapy Dog Wellness Hour
DESCRIPTION:Meet the DCC Therapy Dogs! Bear\, Casper\, and Riley are here
  to help you de-stress and regulate during your busy week!  Riley (on lef
 t) visits on Mondays from 10:30am to 11:30am  Casper (on right) visits on
  Tuesdays from 1:00pm to 2:00pm  Bear (in center) visits on Wednesdays fr
 om 11:30am to 12:30pm  That's THREE days of Therapy dogs in the DCC! Visi
 t us on the third-floor landing of Bertolini to meet our Therapy Dogs and
  checkout all the other cool stuff we have going on!For more information\
 , visit SRJC's DCC website. (https://drd.santarosa.edu/dcc)
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p>  Meet the DCC Therapy Dogs! Bear\, Caspe
 r\, and Riley are here to help you de-stress and regulate during your bus
 y week!<br /><br /></p><p>  Riley (on left) visits on Mondays from 10:30a
 m to 11:30am<br />  Casper (on right) visits on Tuesdays from 1:00pm to 2
 :00pm<br />  Bear (in center) visits on Wednesdays from 11:30am to 12:30p
 m<br /><br /></p><p>  That's THREE days of Therapy dogs in the DCC! Visit
  us on the third-floor landing of Bertolini to meet our Therapy Dogs and 
 checkout all the other cool stuff we have going on!</p><p><a href="https:
 //drd.santarosa.edu/dcc" target="_blank" rel="noopener">For more informat
 ion\, visit SRJC's DCC website.</a></p>
