SUMMARY:Disability Support Hour
DESCRIPTION:This is a weekly meetup for disabled people and allies to com
 e together and find support and community\, ask questions\, or just talk 
 through whatever they may be going through!  Sometimes there is a topic o
 r guest speaker\, or we talk about whatever we feel like bringing up that
  week!  We also have one of our DCC therapy dogs\, Casper\, with us too! 
  We meet every Tuesday from 1:00pm to 2:00pm in the Disability Cultural C
 enter on the 3rd-floor landing of the SRJC Bertolini Student Center. Come
  and check it out!For more information\, visit SRJC's DCC website. (https
 ://drd.santarosa.edu/dcc)
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p>  This is a weekly meetup for disabled pe
 ople and allies to come together and find support and community\, ask que
 stions\, or just talk through whatever they may be going through!</p><p> 
  Sometimes there is a topic or guest speaker\, or we talk about whatever 
 we feel like bringing up that week!</p><p>  We also have one of our DCC t
 herapy dogs\, Casper\, with us too!</p><p>  We meet every Tuesday from 1:
 00pm to 2:00pm in the Disability Cultural Center on the 3rd-floor landing
  of the SRJC Bertolini Student Center. Come and check it out!</p><p><a hr
 ef="https://drd.santarosa.edu/dcc" target="_blank" rel="noopener">For mor
 e information\, visit SRJC's DCC website.</a></p>
