 om 11:30am to 12:30pm  That's THREE days of Therapy dogs in the DCC! Visi
 t us on the third-floor landing of Bertolini to meet our Therapy Dogs and
  checkout all the other cool stuff we have going on!For more information\
 , visit SRJC's DCC website. (https://drd.santarosa.edu/dcc)
