SUMMARY:Sistah 2 Sistah
DESCRIPTION:Check the SRJC Sawubona BLOC website for any event changes. (
 https://bloc.santarosa.edu/august-2026)  Sistah 2 Sistah is a welcoming s
 pace for Black girls and young women to connect\, uplift\, and empower on
 e another.  Through sisterhood\, conversation\, wellness\, education\, le
 adership\, and creative experiences\, students can build meaningful relat
 ionships while growing personally and academically.  Topics and activitie
 s may include:Sisterhood &amp\; community  Self-love and confidence  Acad
 emic &amp\; career success  Wellness and life skills  Leadership and pers
 onal growth  Cultural identity and self-discovery    The Sawubona BLOC is
  located in Pioneer Hall\, Room 360 (next to the bookstore) on the Santa 
 Rosa Campus.
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p><a href="https://bloc.santarosa.edu/augus
 t-2026" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Check the SRJC Sawubona BLOC websi
 te for any event changes.</a></p><p>  Sistah 2 Sistah is a welcoming spac
 e for Black girls and young women to connect\, uplift\, and empower one a
 nother.</p><p>  Through sisterhood\, conversation\, wellness\, education\
 , leadership\, and creative experiences\, students can build meaningful r
 elationships while growing personally and academically.</p><p>  Topics an
 d activities may include:</p><ul><li>Sisterhood &amp\; community  </li><l
 i>Self-love and confidence  </li><li>Academic &amp\; career success  </li
 ><li>Wellness and life skills  </li><li>Leadership and personal growth  <
 /li><li>Cultural identity and self-discovery  </li></ul><p>  The Sawubona
  BLOC is located in Pioneer Hall\, Room 360 (next to the bookstore) on th
 e Santa Rosa Campus.</p>
