SUMMARY:Brother 2 Brother
DESCRIPTION:Check the SRJC Sawubona BLOC website for any event changes. (
 https://bloc.santarosa.edu/august-2026)  Brother 2 Brother provides a spa
 ce for men of color to connect\, grow\, and support one another.  The pro
 gram focuses on building brotherhood while creating opportunities for aca
 demic\, personal\, and professional development.  Topics may include:Acad
 emic success and study strategies  Brotherhood &amp\; community  Personal
  development  Mental health &amp\; wellness  Career and life skills  Lead
 ership and mentorship    &#160\;  The Sawubona BLOC is located in Pioneer
  Hall\, Room 360 (next to the bookstore) on the Santa Rosa Campus.
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p><a href="https://bloc.santarosa.edu/augus
 t-2026" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Check the SRJC Sawubona BLOC websi
 te for any event changes.</a></p><p>  Brother 2 Brother provides a space 
 for men of color to connect\, grow\, and support one another.</p><p>  The
  program focuses on building brotherhood while creating opportunities for
  academic\, personal\, and professional development.</p><p>  Topics may i
 nclude:</p><ul><li>Academic success and study strategies  </li><li>Brothe
 rhood &amp\; community  </li><li>Personal development  </li><li>Mental he
 alth &amp\; wellness  </li><li>Career and life skills  </li><li>Leadershi
 p and mentorship  </li></ul><p>  &#160\;</p><p>  The Sawubona BLOC is loc
 ated in Pioneer Hall\, Room 360 (next to the bookstore) on the Santa Rosa
  Campus.</p>
