 s by jazz greats\, including Thelonious Monk\, Miles Davis and Benny Gols
 on. Pianist Justis Jones is also expected to contribute a vocal performan
 ce.  Admission is $10\, cash only. Tickets will be available for purchase
  at the door. Parking on the SRJC campus is $4.  Proceeds from the concer
 t benefit the SRJC Foundation Jazz Studies Fund.For more information\, vi
 sit the SRJC Music Events website. (https://music.santarosa.edu/events)
