 tations of compositions by jazz greats\, including Thelonious Monk\, Mile
 s Davis and Benny Golson. Pianist Justis Jones is also expected to contri
 bute a vocal performance.<br /><br />  Admission is $10\, cash only. Tick
 ets will be available for purchase at the door. Parking on the SRJC campu
 s is $4.<br /><br />  Proceeds from the concert benefit the SRJC Foundati
 on Jazz Studies Fund.</p><p><a href="https://music.santarosa.edu/events" 
