SUMMARY:Verve Trio - SRJC's Chamber Concert Series
DESCRIPTION:Comprised of pianist Chia-Lin Yang\, violinist Elbert Tsai\, 
 and cellist Brady Anderson\, the trio has engaged audiences with creative
  programs combining familiar masterpieces with an array of duo sonatas an
 d lesser-known gems that often highlight the influence of tango and jazz.
  This piano trio has established itself as a diverse ensemble with a wide
 -ranging repertoire.For more information and tickets\, visit SRJC's Chamb
 er Concert Series website. (https://chamberconcerts.santarosa.edu/)
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p>  Comprised of pianist Chia-Lin Yang\, vi
 olinist Elbert Tsai\, and cellist Brady Anderson\, the trio has engaged a
 udiences with creative programs combining familiar masterpieces with an a
 rray of duo sonatas and lesser-known gems that often highlight the influe
 nce of tango and jazz. This piano trio has established itself as a divers
 e ensemble with a wide-ranging repertoire.</p><p><a href="https://chamber
 concerts.santarosa.edu/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">For more informat
 ion and tickets\, visit SRJC's Chamber Concert Series website.</a></p>
