SUMMARY:Kaplan-Gregory Piano Flute Duo - SRJC's Chamber Concert Series
DESCRIPTION:Gregory is an acclaimed award-winning Australian flutist who 
 has performed internationally.  Kaplan is a dynamic American pianist know
 n for creative recital programming and collaborations.  Their programming
  is exceptional and diverse\; they are passionate artists with outstandin
 g skill.For more information and tickets\, visit SRJC's Chamber Concert S
 eries website. (https://chamberconcerts.santarosa.edu/)
