 ustralian flutist who has performed internationally.<br />  Kaplan is a d
 ynamic American pianist known for creative recital programming and collab
 orations.<br />  Their programming is exceptional and diverse\; they are 
 passionate artists with outstanding skill.</p><p><a href="https://chamber
 concerts.santarosa.edu/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">For more informat
 ion and tickets\, visit SRJC's Chamber Concert Series website.</a></p>
