LOCATION:Burbank Auditorium\, Studio Theatre - Santa Rosa Campus
SUMMARY:Blithe Spirit - SRJC Theatre Arts
DESCRIPTION:Blithe Spirit is a witty 1941 Noël Coward comedy about Charl
 es Condomine. Charles\, a novelist\, is haunted by his temperamental firs
 t wife\, Elvira\, after a séance goes wrong. Elvira disrupts Charles's m
 arriage to his second wife\, Ruth\, resulting in paranormal antics.  &#16
 0\;Ticketing:Visit SRJC's Theatre Arts tickets page for details and ticke
 ts. (https://srjc.universitytickets.com/w/event.aspx?SeriesID=35)
