 ël Coward comedy about Charles Condomine. Charles\, a novelist\, is haun
 ted by his temperamental first wife\, Elvira\, after a séance goes wrong
 . Elvira disrupts Charles's marriage to his second wife\, Ruth\, resultin
 g in paranormal antics.</p><p>  &#160\;</p><p><strong>Ticketing:</strong>
 <a href="https://srjc.universitytickets.com/w/event.aspx?SeriesID=35" tar
 get="_blank" rel="noopener">Visit SRJC's Theatre Arts tickets page for de
 tails and tickets.</a></p>
