SUMMARY:Notos Piano Quartett - SRJC's Chamber Concert Series
DESCRIPTION:Founded in 2007\, the Berlin-based piano quartet first drew a
 ttention by winning first prize in six major international competitions. 
 Since that time\, the quartet has played around the world\, has been reci
 pient of numerous music prizes and has commissioned multiple pieces.  Sin
 dri Lederer\, violin\; Andrea Burger\, viola\; Benjamin Lai\, cello\; Ant
 onia Köster\, piano  &#160\;For more information and tickets\, visit SRJ
 C's Chamber Concert Series website. (https://chamberconcerts.santarosa.ed
 u/)
