LOCATION:Burbank Auditorium\, Main Stage Theatre - Santa Rosa Campus
SUMMARY:Little Shop of Horrors - SRJC Theatre Arts
DESCRIPTION:Little Shop of Horrors is a horror-comedy rock musical\, by c
 omposer Alan Menken and writer Howard Ashman. It focuses on a meek floris
 t\, Seymour\, who raises an alien plant\, Audrey II\, but the plant deman
 ds a special type of food…As the plant grows Seymour is caught up with 
 fame and renown\, but an ever-increasing threat of losing control. What f
 ate will become of Seymour and humanity? Come and find out at the Little 
 Shop of Horrors!Ticketing:Visit SRJC's Theatre Arts tickets page for deta
 ils and tickets. (https://srjc.universitytickets.com/w/event.aspx?SeriesI
 D=36)
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p><em>Little Shop of Horrors</em> is a horr
 or-comedy rock musical\, by composer Alan Menken and writer Howard Ashman
 . It focuses on a meek florist\, Seymour\, who raises an alien plant\, Au
 drey II\, but the plant demands a special type of food…As the plant gro
 ws Seymour is caught up with fame and renown\, but an ever-increasing thr
 eat of losing control. What fate will become of Seymour and humanity? Com
 e and find out at the <em>Little Shop of Horrors</em>!</p><p><strong>Tick
 eting:</strong><a href="https://srjc.universitytickets.com/w/event.aspx?S
 eriesID=36" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Visit SRJC's Theatre Arts tick
 ets page for details and tickets.</a></p>
